# The image is built from these files only (Dockerfile): the Python package, the web
# application's sources, and the privacy notice and terms that it shows. Nothing else
# from the working tree reaches the build, so local state, keys and build output never
# end up in an image.
*
!core/pyproject.toml
!core/uv.lock
!core/README.md
!core/LICENSE
!core/src/
!web/
!docs/legal/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.e2e-stack/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/demo/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
